\p{The upper curve is the voltage, in millivolts, and the lower
curves are the sodium conductance (solid) and the potassium
conductance (dashed), in
#{{\mathrm{mS}}/{\mathrm{cm}}^{2}}. The time axis is in
milliseconds. The drawing follows the quantities in Figure 1.14.}
